OL,3,AStephen King's Carrie returns to
OL,4,Aexplore the horrors of social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdaptations, remakes and reboots are
OL,7,Fall the rage right now, and there's
OL,8,Foften one question that crops up - why?
OL,10,FSee also "what's the point?" and "do we
OL,11,Fneed another one?" whenever a story is
OL,12,Fresurrected from the past.
OL,14,FCarrie, Prime Video's new TV series
OL,15,Fbased on Stephen King's debut novel,
OL,16,Fhas been no exception.
OL,18,FIt's not the first time the tale of
OL,19,Fhigh school bullies and supernatural
OL,20,Fpowers has been adapted for the screen.
